:attr:`ord` defines the vector norm that is computed. The following norms are supported:

======================   ===============================
:attr:`ord`              vector norm
======================   ===============================
`2` (default)            `2`-norm (see below)
`inf`                    `max(abs(x))`
`-inf`                   `min(abs(x))`
`0`                      `sum(x != 0)`
other `int` or `float`   `sum(abs(x)^{ord})^{(1 / ord)}`
======================   ===============================

